@baseUrl = https://localhost:7057
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_USER_ID

### Read actual workspace users before mapping the paper's sample names
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clockify/users
Accept: application/json

### Import: creates/reuses remote records and persists them locally
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clockify/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "projectName": "Website Redesign",
      "taskName": "Homepage Mockup",
      "assignedUserClockifyId": "{{userId}}",
      "originalEstimateHours": 7
    }
  ],
  "timeEntries": [
    {
      "userClockifyId": "{{userId}}",
      "projectName": "Website Redesign",
      "taskName": "Homepage Mockup",
      "start": "2025-07-20T09:15:00Z",
      "end": "2025-07-20T11:45:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### Synchronize remote records into MySQL; inspect isComplete and issues
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clockify/sync
Accept: application/json

### Preview the report using local data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/time
Accept: application/json

### Download CSV; running-timer count is included in the response headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/time/csv
Accept: text/csv
